2026-09-23 00:34:20,676 | INFO | [public-fetch] [agents] name=bull mode=backtesting model=gemini-3.5-flash-lite cache_hit=False tokens_in=53317 tokens_out=365 tokens_cached_in=28226 tokens_uncached_in=25091 tokens_thinking=0 tokens_total=53682 latency_ms=3906 first_event_latency_ms=787 tool_calls=2 observability_warnings=0 summary='Based on the provided U.S. House of Representatives Periodic Transaction Report (PTR) under the STOCK Act (PDF URL: `https://disclosures-clerk.house.gov/public_disc/ptr-pdfs/2026/20033725.pdf`), here is the bull case argument for the key companies and transactions disclosed in the filing:  1. **Alphabet Inc. (GOOGL)** & **Amazon.com, Inc. (AMZN)**: Continued heavy representation and activity in dominant mega-cap technology leaders point to strong confidence in their sustained cloud infrastructure, artificial intelligence monetization, and dominant digital advertising/e-commerce cash flows. 2. **NVIDIA Corporation (NVDA)**: Involvement in NVIDIA underscores a continued bullish outlook on accelerated computing, artificial intelligence infrastructure, and the immense secular demand for enterprise AI hardware. 3. **The Walt Disney Company (DIS)**: Exposure to Disney highlights optimism around the ongoing turnaround in streaming profitability, park segment resilience, and media content monetization. 4. **Vistra Corp. (VST)**: Participation in Vistra aligns with the powerful secular tailwind of power generation and utility demand driven by expanding data centers and AI-related energy consumption. 5. **Tempus AI, Inc. (TEM)** & **PayPal Holdings, Inc. (PYPL)**: Inclusion of growth and fintech innovators indicates selective positioning in high-growth healthcare technology and digital payments sectors.  *Note: No orders are submitted as per instructions.*  RESULT: Analyzed the congressional Periodic Transaction Report and formulated the bull case arguments across disclosed transactions without executing any trades.' trace=/Users/robertgrzesik/Library/Caches/lumibot/1.0/agent_runtime/traces/bull/2d972b9d55656c540598d77580c4d5178cd658b12160a9cb3e92782958cfc7c3-20260923043420654446.json
