1. **Alphabet Inc. (GOOGL)** & **Amazon.com, Inc. (AMZN)**: Continued heavy representation and activity in dominant mega-cap technology leaders point to strong confidence in their sustained cloud infrastructure, artificial intelligence monetization, and dominant digital advertising/e-commerce cash flows.
